WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:06.330
FIRST SNOWFALL Today is November 26th.

2
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.410
It snowed all day today.

3
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.910
The snow is beautiful.

4
00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.930
The snow finally stopped.

5
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.050
My sister and I are excited.

6
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.050
My mom doesn't like the snow.

7
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.130
My mom has to shovel the driveway.

8
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.150
My sister and I get to play.

9
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.370
I put on my hat and mittens.

10
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.850
My mom puts on my scarf.

11
00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.610
My mom zippers my jacket.

12
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.210
My sister puts on her hat and mittens.

13
00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.990
My mom puts on her scarf.

14
00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:43.970
My mom zippers her jacket.

15
00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.950
My sister and I go outside.

16
00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.010
We begin to make a snowman.

17
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.170
My mom starts to shovel the snow.

18
00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.310
My sister and I make snow angels.

19
00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.490
My sister and I throw snowballs.

20
00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.910
It starts to snow again.

21
00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.930
We go inside for hot chocolate.
